// OtherCreaturesYouControl = the anthem-family distribution set: "each other
// creature you control" ([CR#613.6] anthem shape). A Selection-kind macro —
// the whole `SelectAll(...)` IS the macro body, so a card spells the anthem
// as `Each(OtherCreaturesYouControl, Modify(It, <boost>))` directly, no
// nested `SelectAll` at the call site. Nests the reusable
// `OtherCreatureYouControl` Predicate atom rather than repeating its
// `And([...])` filter inline.
(
    name: "OtherCreaturesYouControl",
    template: "each other creature you control",
    kinds: [Selection],
    body: SelectAll(OtherCreatureYouControl),
)
